      "completeness": 5,
      "style_fit": 4
    },
    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Full-length bolt-action rifle with a camo-wrapped buttstock and fore-end, exposed wood along the barrel channel, receiver, bolt handle, trigger group, barrel bands, front and rear sights. Side views confirm a genuinely thin profile and the top view shows the sight line and bolt correctly. No proof marks, arsenal stamps or manufacturer name are legible on receiver or stock.",
    "limitations": [
      "Recognisable historical rifle pattern, unbranded; some marketplaces restrict weapons content.",
      "Static: the bolt does not cycle and no magazine or ammunition is included.",
      "The camo wrap is texture only, not separate cloth geometry."
    ],
